#: clients/networkmanager/handler.cpp
msgid "The hotspot could not be started. The Wi-Fi adapter may not support it on this channel or with this password."
msgstr "无法启动热点。Wi-Fi 适配器可能不支持在此信道或使用此密码运行热点。"

